<title>RUSSIA: Duma urges ban on foreign investment in alcohol.</title>
<headline>Duma urges ban on foreign investment in alcohol.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's State Duma lower house of parliament called on Friday for a ban on foreign investment in the production and trade of ethyl spirit and alcoholic products.</p>
<p>The Duma, in a first reading, passed amendments calling for the ban to the law on foreign investment.</p>
<p>The International Monetary Fund has been putting pressure on the Russian government to end restrictions on foreign activity in the alcohol and vodka industries.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
